# Title: Imperative English subject, capitalized, no trailing period
#   e.g. Run ruff on staged files only in pre-commit

# Remember blank line between title and body.

# Body (optional): explain *what* and *why*, not *how*. Wrap at 72 chars.
# Branch: <type>/<slug>. PRs are squash-merged, so the PR title becomes
# the commit subject on main — title PRs the same way.
